sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Recipe as Recipe
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Recipe: retire(reason)
    Note over Recipe: Policies: recipeRead, recipeWrite, recipeExecute
    Note over Recipe: Guards (3)
    Recipe->>Recipe: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;draft#quot; or self.status == #quot;published#quot;
    Recipe->>Recipe: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Recipe->>Recipe: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;kitchenManageAccess#quot;)
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.status
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.retiredAt
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.retirementReason
    Recipe->>EventBus: emit RecipeRetired on recipe.retired
    Recipe-->>-Client: void